# Implementation Plan: Real-Time Market Resolution Notifications

## Requirements Restatement
- Send notifications to users when markets they're watching resolve
- Support multiple notification channels (in-app, email, database)
- Ensure notifications are delivered reliably using Laravel Queue
- Include market outcome and user's position result
- Display notifications in the app header

## Implementation Phases

### Phase 1: Database Schema & Migrations
- Create notifications table migration:
  * id, type, notifiable_type, notifiable_id, data (json), read_at, created_at
- Create user_notification_preferences table:
  * user_id, email_notifications, database_notifications
- Add indexes on notifiable_type, notifiable_id for performance
- Run: php artisan make:migration create_notifications_table

### Phase 2: Backend - Events & Notifications
- Create MarketResolved event (app/Events/MarketResolved.php)
- Create MarketResolvedNotification class (app/Notifications/MarketResolvedNotification.php)
  * Implement via mail and database channels
  * Include market name, outcome, user's position result
- Create NotificationService (app/Services/NotificationService.php)
  * Method: notifyMarketResolution(Market $market)
  * Query users with positions in the market
- Fire MarketResolved event in MarketController@resolve
- Create listener: SendMarketResolvedNotifications
- Register in EventServiceProvider

### Phase 3: Backend - API Endpoints
- Add routes in routes/web.php:
  * GET /notifications - List user's notifications
  * POST /notifications/{id}/mark-as-read - Mark single as read
  * POST /notifications/mark-all-read - Mark all as read
  * GET /notifications/unread-count - Get count for badge
- Create NotificationController with above methods
- Add Inertia responses for notification pages

### Phase 4: Frontend - Vue 3 Components (Options API)
- Create NotificationBell.vue component (resources/js/components/)
  * Show unread count badge
  * Dropdown with notification list
  * Poll for new notifications every 30 seconds
  * Use Options API (data, computed, methods, mounted)
- Create NotificationItem.vue component
  * Display notification message
  * Mark as read on click
  * Show timestamp with relative time
- Add NotificationBell to AppHeader.vue
- Create NotificationPreferences.vue page (resources/js/pages/settings/)
  * Toggle email notifications
  * Toggle in-app notifications
  * Use Inertia form helper

### Phase 5: Queue & Jobs
- Create SendMarketNotifications job (app/Jobs/SendMarketNotifications.php)
  * Dispatch to queue for async processing
  * Implement handle() method
- Configure queue driver in .env (database or redis)
- Add queue worker command to supervisor/deployment

### Phase 6: Testing
- Feature tests (tests/Feature/NotificationTest.php):
  * Test notifications sent when market resolves
  * Test notification preferences work
  * Test mark as read functionality
- Unit tests (tests/Unit/MarketResolvedNotificationTest.php):
  * Test notification content format
  * Test channel selection based on preferences
- Inertia tests for notification components

