## Risks
- HIGH: Email deliverability (SPF/DKIM/DMARC configuration required)
- HIGH: Queue worker must be running (supervisor/systemd setup)
- MEDIUM: Performance with 1000+ users per market (batch notifications)
- MEDIUM: Notification spam if markets resolve frequently (add throttling)
- LOW: Polling overhead (consider Laravel Broadcasting for real-time)

